          "previewAudio": "",
          "description": "Speak, Repeat, and Learn Mandarin; One Word at a Time!\nLittle Mandarin 小小中文 is a fun and gentle way for toddlers to start learning Mandarin through clear, simple repetition. Each track introduces daily words and phrases, giving little learners the chance to hear, repeat, and remember. Just like how we learn our first language!\nPerfect for curious toddlers and bilingual families, this playlist builds basic vocabulary and confidence through everyday topics.",
